          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Confirm eligibility, premiums, and the effect of your retirement type on health insurance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-canvas/50 p-6">
          <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-accent">06</p>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Get an official annuity estimate</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Contact HR or OPM when you are close to retirement for a formal estimate based on official records.</p>
