        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-normal text-ink sm:text-4xl">
          A pension choice with long-term consequences.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Electing a survivor benefit reduces your own annuity during your lifetime but provides continuing income to your spouse after your death.
        </p>
